@page "/error"

<PageTitle>Something went wrong — PMO360</PageTitle>

<div class="page">
    <h1 class="page-title">Something went wrong</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">The portal could not complete that request.</p>
    <div class="card" style="max-width:640px">
        <p>
            Nothing you were working on has been lost unless the page says otherwise: an update is
            saved in one step, so it is either written in full or not written at all.
        </p>
        <p class="muted small">
            If this keeps happening, tell IT Support what you were doing and roughly when. The error has
            been logged with a time stamp.
        </p>
        <a class="btn primary" href="/">Back to the dashboard</a>
    </div>
</div>
